---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="acquisition" class="bg-rose-950 text-ivory-50">
  <div class="border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="container-narrow py-14 sm:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <p class="mb-4 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widestx text-gold-400">Domain Available</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">
          Acquire <span class="italic text-gold-300">EssenceWaxStudio.com</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-rose-200 sm:text-base">
          A polished studio name for Brazilian wax, hard-wax services, and an appointment-led brand.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com?subject=Domain%20Inquiry%3A%20EssenceWaxStudio.com" class="inline-flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-400 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-rose-950 hover:bg-gold-300 sm:w-auto">
            sales@desertrich.com
          </a>
          <span class="text-sm text-rose-300">Serious inquiries only</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-rose-400">Confidential. Response within 1–2 business days.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-narrow py-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-lg text-white">Essence Wax Studio</p>
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widestx text-rose-400">Informational platform</p>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-md text-xs leading-relaxed text-rose-400 sm:text-right">
        This website is for demonstration and informational purposes only. It does not constitute an offer of services,
        a commitment to deploy, or a guarantee of outcomes. All statistics, projections, and references to specific
        technologies are based on publicly available information as of the date shown and are subject to change.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-xs text-rose-500 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {currentYear} Essence Wax Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Astro · Cloudflare Workers Static Assets · Stream</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
